{"id":"633611","name":"咸萝卜肉丁包","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633611/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"咸萝卜","amount":"3个"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"400g"},{"name":"发好的面团","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"干面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"咸萝卜洗净。","img":"images/633611/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"打丝，冷水浸泡。","img":"images/633611/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"直到把咸菜丝泡的没有咸味。","img":"images/633611/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取猪肉，一定要有肥肉菜好吃。","img":"images/633611/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"猪肉切丁，肥瘦分开。","img":"images/633611/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/633611/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"油热放食盐。","img":"images/633611/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放肥肉。","img":"images/633611/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把肥肉的大部分油脂炒出来。","img":"images/633611/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放椒盐粉。","img":"images/633611/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"切葱姜末。","img":"images/633611/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放瘦肉和葱姜末。","img":"images/633611/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放生抽，炒均匀。","img":"images/633611/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"把咸菜丝攥干水分。","img":"images/633611/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"稍微切一下。","img":"images/633611/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放肉丁及翻炒均匀。","img":"images/633611/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"关火，放鸡精和老抽。","img":"images/633611/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"扒拉均匀即可。","img":"images/633611/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"发好的面。","img":"images/633611/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"揉光排气。","img":"images/633611/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"分成剂子擀皮。","img":"images/633611/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"包包子。","img":"images/633611/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"放蒸笼里二次发酵。","img":"images/633611/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"发好了包子大火烧开，改中火25分钟关火焖5分钟即可。","img":"images/633611/step_24.jpg"}],"tips":"跟梅干菜肉包有异曲同工之妙。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}